      <property name="sizePolicy"><sizepolicy hsizetype="Preferred" vsizetype="Fixed"><horstretch>0</horstretch><verstretch>0</verstretch></sizepolicy></property><property name="text">
       <string>One row per detected servo, in ascending servo ID order. Paste the joint names in that same order, comma separated, then press Apply Names.

1. Hold the arm at its middle pose, then Set Home. Writes Position Offset Value so that pose reads mid scale, and resets position limits to full range.
2. Start Recording, move every joint slowly through its full range, then Stop.
3. Export JSON. For a continuous-rotation joint, type the full range by hand (0 and 4095 on a 12 bit servo).</string>
      </property>
      <property name="wordWrap">
       <bool>true</bool>
      </property>
